        {
          "text": "Me gima Rwoth Were onyuthan menyirok man. Aneno go lwoŋo gir'acula gi mac, aka osika woko lutho madwoŋ aka oyido camo woko lowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.4",
