          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Amos odwoko Amaziya ni, “Akibedo jatuci wac Were ma tuco wac Were ma cul. Abedo jakwath dhok, aka akuro yen makuyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Rwoth okwanyan bedo jakwath dhok to oran bino tuco wac Were ri ji pere Isiraili.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno pama winji wac pa Rwoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.7.16"
            ]
